COMMENT     The assembly wpAliVire1.1 is based on 49x PacBio data and Arima2
            Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project
            (https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included
            the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation
            with Hifiasm, retained haplotig separation with purge_dups, and
            Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was
            assembled using MitoHifi. Finally, the assembly was analysed and
            manually improved using rapid curation. Chromosome-scale scaffolds
            confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size.
            Repetitive scaffolds have been inserted into a repeat region of
            chromosome 4. Their order and orientation is uncertain.
